  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PtX Dialogue: Building a global knowledge and exchange platform for PtX</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the International PtX Hub, PtX Dialogue enabled emerging economies and developing countries to contribute to the international market ramp-up of sustainable electricity-based raw materials and fuels (&#x201c;Power-to-X&#x201d;, including hydrogen). Basic and in-depth training for political decision-makers in partner countries formed the basis for developing visions for future PtX production and markets. In demand markets, PtX Dialogue also provided impulses for sustainability standards and developed recommendations for political framework conditions for the sectors aviation, shipping and chemical industry. In addition, the project in Kenya has been working on integrating PtX into long-term climate strategies, developing the national market and generating added value locally via international markets. PtX Dialog publishes knowledge products, conducted training courses and workshops worldwide and promoted networks and partnerships, such as Women in Green Hydrogen.</narrative>
  </description>
